{% comment %}
  ==========================================================================
  ZeroStick EXO product visuals: THE ONE SWAP POINT
  --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Every staged EXO page (landing v2, pre-order product page, games page,
  manual v2) draws the product through this snippet, so when the official
  marketing renders / GLB arrive (ZS CORE\Enclosure\REV 2 v3 ...\MARKETING\)
  you only change the file names in the "asset names" block below.

  3D files: exo2-case.glb = MARKETING\web\exo-web-draco.glb (Draco, ~665 KB),
  exo2-case-full.glb = MARKETING\web\exo-web.glb (fallback).
  The old matched renders (exo2-hero-34, exo2-top, exo2-front, exo2-exploded,
  exo2-lid-off, exo2-ports-*, exo2-board-*, exo2-poster) were retired on
  2026-11-24: every picture below is photoreal.

  PHOTOREAL SET (2026-11-22, owner-approved), from ...\PHOTOREAL\:
    exo3-<key>-{800,1600,2400}.webp  responsive WebP, served with srcset
      hero-<blue|purple|red|green|white>  stills/01-hero-3q-front_<c>
      top            stills/02-top-logo_blue
      back-ports     stills/04-back-ports_blue      front-ports  stills/06-front-ports-closeup_blue
      underside      stills/05-underside            desk         stills/07-lifestyle-desk_blue
      ports-back-lbl / ports-front-lbl  amazon-white/03-back-ports + 02-front with port
                     callouts drawn at the PORTS.md positions (back: CONSOLE, AUX/POWER,
                     AUTH, HDMI IN, HDMI OUT; front: USB-C + 3 x USB-A)
    exo3-logo-<c>-{400,800}.webp     stills/03-logo-closeup_<c> (colour swatches)
    exo3-poster-{800,1600}.webp      MARKETING\web\exo-poster.jpg
    exo3-logo-loop.mp4/.webm (+ -poster.webp)  animation/ZS-EXO_logo-wave-loop, 720p
    exo2-case-full.glb               MARKETING\web\exo-web.glb (fallback when Draco fails)
    exo3-hw-<console|aux|auth|hdmi>-{800,1600,2400}.webp  single-port close-ups
                     cropped from stills/04-back-ports_blue (manual), made 2026-11-24
  There is no photoreal exploded or lid-off view, so those views are gone:
  old view names ('exploded', 'lid-off', 'hero-render', 'board-*') now fall
  back to the photoreal hero / top so no page can show an old render.

  Usage:
    {% render 'zs-exo2-visual', view: 'viewer' %}             interactive 3D
    {% render 'zs-exo2-visual', view: 'hero', loading: 'eager' %}
    photoreal: 'hero' (colour: 'red'...), 'top', 'back-ports', 'front-ports', 'underside', 'desk',
               'ports-back' / 'ports-front' (labelled)
    {% render 'zs-exo2-visual', view: 'colours' %}   logo colour gallery
    {% render 'zs-exo2-visual', view: 'loop' %}      rainbow logo loop video
  Optional: class: 'my-class', alt: 'custom alt text', sizes: '(max-width: 989px) 100vw, 50vw'
  ==========================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign f_glb = 'exo2-case.glb'
  assign f_glb_full = 'exo2-case-full.glb'
  assign f_ports_back = 'exo3-ports-back-lbl-1600.webp'
  assign v = view | default: 'hero'
  assign lazy = loading | default: 'lazy'
-%}

{%- if v == 'viewer' -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Interactive 3D. The poster still shows instantly; assets/zs-exo2.js only
    downloads the model-viewer library and the model when this scrolls near
    the screen, then cross-fades to the live model (drag to spin, pinch/scroll
    to zoom). Reduced-motion users get no auto-rotate.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="x2-stage {{ class }}" data-x2-model data-x2-rainbow>
    <img class="x2-stage-poster" src="{{ 'exo3-poster-1600.webp' | asset_url }}"
         srcset="{{ 'exo3-poster-800.webp' | asset_url }} 800w, {{ 'exo3-poster-1600.webp' | asset_url }} 1600w"
         sizes="{{ sizes | default: '(max-width: 989px) 100vw, 55vw' }}" width="1600" height="1067"
         alt="{{ alt | default: 'ZeroStick EXO, 3D view' | escape }}" loading="{{ lazy }}" decoding="async"{% if lazy == 'eager' %} fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}>
    <model-viewer data-src="{{ f_glb | asset_url }}" data-fallback="{{ f_glb_full | asset_url }}" alt="{{ alt | default: 'Interactive 3D model of the ZeroStick EXO. Drag to rotate.' | escape }}"
      camera-controls touch-action="pan-y" auto-rotate auto-rotate-delay="0" rotation-per-second="14deg"
      interaction-prompt="none" camera-orbit="-32deg 64deg auto" min-camera-orbit="auto 10deg auto" max-camera-orbit="auto 95deg auto"
      field-of-view="20deg" min-field-of-view="12deg" max-field-of-view="26deg"
      exposure="0.95" shadow-intensity="1.2" shadow-softness="0.9" environment-image="neutral" tone-mapping="aces"
      disable-pan></model-viewer>
    <p class="x2-stage-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-3-6.7"/><path d="M21 4v5h-5"/></svg>
      Drag to rotate
    </p>
  </div>
{%- elsif v == 'ports' -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Hover/tap-to-explain 3D PORT VIEWER (owner-approved 2026-11-21).
    Each hotspot sits on a port of the final web GLB. Positions (metres, model
    space) are the centres of the final web GLB's port nodes (measured from
    MARKETING\web\exo-web.glb, which is centred on the case): port_CONSOLE, port_AUX_POWER, port_AUTH, port_HDMI_IN, port_HDMI_OUT,
    port_FRONT_USB_C, port_FRONT_USB_A_1..3:
    move a dot by editing its data-position. data-normal points out of the
    face the port is on (back = 0 0 -1, front = 0 0 1).
    The explanation panel and the Front/Back buttons are driven by
    assets/zs-exo2.js ("port viewer" block).
    Port facts: verified by MAIN EXO CHAT against the moulded labels + board.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="x2-ports {{ class }}" data-x2-ports>
    <div class="x2-stage x2-stage--ports" data-x2-model>
      <img class="x2-stage-poster" src="{{ f_ports_back | asset_url }}" width="1600" height="933"
           alt="ZeroStick EXO back panel with each port named: CONSOLE, AUX/POWER, AUTH, HDMI IN and HDMI OUT" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <model-viewer data-src="{{ f_glb | asset_url }}" data-fallback="{{ f_glb_full | asset_url }}" alt="3D model of the ZeroStick EXO with a marker on every port"
        camera-controls touch-action="pan-y" interaction-prompt="none" disable-pan disable-zoom
        camera-orbit="180deg 72deg auto" field-of-view="15deg" interpolation-decay="120"
        exposure="0.95" shadow-intensity="1" environment-image="neutral" tone-mapping="aces">
        <button slot="hotspot-console" class="x2-hot" data-port="console" data-position="0.04102m 0.00748m -0.0336m" data-normal="0m 0m -1m" data-visibility-attribute="visible" aria-label="CONSOLE port"><span>1</span></button>
        <button slot="hotspot-aux" class="x2-hot" data-port="aux" data-position="0.02702m 0.00748m -0.0336m" data-normal="0m 0m -1m" data-visibility-attribute="visible" aria-label="AUX/POWER port"><span>2</span></button>
        <button slot="hotspot-auth" class="x2-hot" data-port="auth" data-position="0.00945m 0.00935m -0.0336m" data-normal="0m 0m -1m" data-visibility-attribute="visible" aria-label="AUTH port"><span>3</span></button>
        <button slot="hotspot-hdmi-in" class="x2-hot" data-port="hdmi-in" data-position="-0.01135m 0.00915m -0.0336m" data-normal="0m 0m -1m" data-visibility-attribute="visible" aria-label="HDMI IN port"><span>4</span></button>
        <button slot="hotspot-hdmi-out" class="x2-hot" data-port="hdmi-out" data-position="-0.03485m 0.00915m -0.0336m" data-normal="0m 0m -1m" data-visibility-attribute="visible" aria-label="HDMI OUT port"><span>5</span></button>
        <button slot="hotspot-front-1" class="x2-hot" data-port="front" data-position="-0.03535m 0.00748m 0.0336m" data-normal="0m 0m 1m" data-visibility-attribute="visible" aria-label="Front USB-C port"><span>6</span></button>
        <button slot="hotspot-front-2" class="x2-hot" data-port="front" data-position="-0.01178m 0.00935m 0.0336m" data-normal="0m 0m 1m" data-visibility-attribute="visible" aria-label="Front USB-A port"><span>7</span></button>
        <button slot="hotspot-front-3" class="x2-hot" data-port="front" data-position="0.01178m 0.00935m 0.0336m" data-normal="0m 0m 1m" data-visibility-attribute="visible" aria-label="Front USB-A port"><span>8</span></button>
        <button slot="hotspot-front-4" class="x2-hot" data-port="front" data-position="0.03535m 0.00935m 0.0336m" data-normal="0m 0m 1m" data-visibility-attribute="visible" aria-label="Front USB-A port"><span>9</span></button>
      </model-viewer>
    </div>
    <div class="x2-ports-side">
      <div class="x2-ports-flip" role="group" aria-label="Show side">
        <button type="button" data-face="back" aria-pressed="true">Back</button>
        <button type="button" data-face="front" aria-pressed="false">Front</button>
      </div>
      <ol class="x2-ports-list">
        <li data-port="console" data-face="back"><b><i>1</i>CONSOLE <small>USB-C</small></b><p>The play cable, always. It goes to your PS5 or Xbox, or to your PC when you play on PC. The EXO powers itself from it.</p></li>
        <li data-port="aux" data-face="back"><b><i>2</i>AUX/POWER <small>USB-C</small></b><p>Optional extra power from any USB charger or PC USB port. Never required. Handy when you charge controllers through the EXO or run several powered devices.</p></li>
        <li data-port="auth" data-face="back"><b><i>3</i>AUTH <small>USB-A</small></b><p>PS5 version: the included PS5 auth dongle. Xbox version: your own genuine Xbox controller.</p></li>
        <li data-port="hdmi-in" data-face="back"><b><i>4</i>HDMI IN</b><p>From your console. This is how the EXO sees the game for automatic gun detection.</p></li>
        <li data-port="hdmi-out" data-face="back"><b><i>5</i>HDMI OUT</b><p>To your TV or monitor. Your picture passes straight through.</p></li>
        <li data-port="front" data-face="front"><b><i>6–9</i>Front ports <small>1 × USB-C + 3 × USB-A</small></b><p>Plug in controllers, a mouse, a keyboard or a USB hub. Any front port works for any of them.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- elsif v == 'colours' -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Logo colour gallery: the big photo swaps when a swatch is picked
    (assets/zs-exo2.js, "logo colour gallery"). Hidden photos are lazy and
    display:none, so only the colour someone picks is downloaded.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign cols = 'blue,purple,red,green,white' | split: ',' -%}
  <div class="x2-colours {{ class }}" data-x2-colours>
    <div class="x2-colours-main">
      {%- for c in cols -%}
        {%- assign k = 'exo3-hero-' | append: c -%}
        <img data-c-img="{{ c }}"{% if forloop.first %} class="is-on"{% endif %}
             src="{{ k | append: '-1600.webp' | asset_url }}"
             srcset="{{ k | append: '-800.webp' | asset_url }} 800w, {{ k | append: '-1600.webp' | asset_url }} 1600w, {{ k | append: '-2400.webp' | asset_url }} 2400w"
             sizes="{{ sizes | default: '(max-width: 989px) 100vw, 60vw' }}" width="1600" height="1067" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
             alt="ZeroStick EXO with the ZS EXO logo lit {{ c }}">
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    <div class="x2-colours-pick" role="group" aria-label="Logo colour">
      {%- for c in cols -%}
        {%- assign k = 'exo3-logo-' | append: c -%}
        <button type="button" data-c-btn="{{ c }}" aria-pressed="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
          <img src="{{ k | append: '-400.webp' | asset_url }}" srcset="{{ k | append: '-400.webp' | asset_url }} 400w, {{ k | append: '-800.webp' | asset_url }} 800w"
               sizes="(max-width: 989px) 20vw, 12rem" width="400" height="267" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="">
          <span>{{ c | capitalize }}</span>
        </button>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- elsif v == 'loop' -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Rainbow logo loop (8 s, 720p, no sound). Muted + playsinline so phones
    autoplay it. The sources only load when it nears the screen and it
    pauses off screen (assets/zs-exo2.js, "logo loop video"). Reduced
    motion: no autoplay, the poster shows with play controls.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <video class="x2-loop {{ class }}" data-x2-video muted loop playsinline autoplay preload="none" width="1280" height="720"
         poster="{{ 'exo3-logo-loop-poster.webp' | asset_url }}"
         aria-label="{{ alt | default: 'The ZeroStick EXO logo glowing through the colours of the rainbow' | escape }}">
    <source data-src="{{ 'exo3-logo-loop.webm' | asset_url }}" type="video/webm">
    <source data-src="{{ 'exo3-logo-loop.mp4' | asset_url }}" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
{%- else -%}
  {%- liquid
    # photoreal stills (responsive srcset)
    assign w = 1600
    assign h = 1067
    case v
      when 'hero'
        assign c = colour | default: 'blue'
        assign key = 'exo3-hero-' | append: c
        assign default_alt = 'ZeroStick EXO: white body, black lid with the ZS EXO logo lit ' | append: c
      when 'top', 'board-top', 'board-bottom'
        assign key = 'exo3-top'
        assign default_alt = 'ZeroStick EXO seen from above: black lid with the lit ZS EXO logo'
      when 'back-ports', 'ports-34-back'
        assign key = 'exo3-back-ports'
        assign default_alt = 'ZeroStick EXO back, left to right: CONSOLE (USB-C), AUX/POWER (USB-C), AUTH (USB-A), HDMI IN and HDMI OUT'
      when 'front-ports', 'ports-34-front', 'front'
        assign key = 'exo3-front-ports'
        assign default_alt = 'Close-up of the ZeroStick EXO front: one USB-C port and three USB-A ports'
      when 'underside'
        assign key = 'exo3-underside'
        assign default_alt = 'ZeroStick EXO underside: white base with a honeycomb pattern and four rubber feet'
      when 'desk'
        assign key = 'exo3-desk'
        assign default_alt = 'ZeroStick EXO on a desk with its logo lit blue and cables plugged in'
      when 'ports-back'
        assign key = 'exo3-ports-back-lbl'
        assign h = 933
        assign default_alt = 'ZeroStick EXO back, seen from behind, left to right: CONSOLE (USB-C, to the console or PC), AUX/POWER (USB-C, optional extra power), AUTH (USB-A, PS5 auth dongle or Xbox controller), HDMI IN (from the console), HDMI OUT (to the TV)'
      when 'ports-front'
        assign key = 'exo3-ports-front-lbl'
        assign h = 933
        assign default_alt = 'ZeroStick EXO front: one USB-C port on the left and three USB-A ports, for controllers, mouse, keyboard or a USB hub'
      else
        assign key = 'exo3-hero-blue'
        assign default_alt = 'ZeroStick EXO: white body, black lid with the ZS EXO logo lit blue'
    endcase
  -%}
  <img class="{{ class }}" src="{{ key | append: '-1600.webp' | asset_url }}"
       srcset="{{ key | append: '-800.webp' | asset_url }} 800w, {{ key | append: '-1600.webp' | asset_url }} 1600w, {{ key | append: '-2400.webp' | asset_url }} 2400w"
       sizes="{{ sizes | default: '(max-width: 989px) 100vw, 50vw' }}" width="{{ w }}" height="{{ h }}"
       alt="{{ alt | default: default_alt | escape }}" loading="{{ lazy }}" decoding="async"
       {% if lazy == 'eager' %}fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}>
{%- endif -%}
